This package is a fork of capnweb (https://github.com/cloudflare/capnweb) at the
v0.12.0 release commit 7702075. The source is unchanged except for one fix in
src/types.d.ts: UnstubifyInner spreads a tuple tail through UnstubifyAll<Tail>
instead of Unstubify<Tail>. Unstubify<Tail> is a union that includes Promise, so
the upstream declarations fail with TS2574 ("A rest element type must be an
array type") under skipLibCheck: false and lose tuple parameter types.
Drop this fork when upstream capnweb publishes the fix.
